5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I worry about the social friction. If we pick a rigid rule, will people start timing their exits to avoid each other?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,The morning rush is getting rough. I want to see how the bikes are actually positioned and who is struggling to get out.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Nobody ever checks the actual costs. I need to know what the building pays and what a household pays if they have no space.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,The last two maintenance jobs fell on one person and then stopped. I need to know the real workload involved.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,People say the same spots always go to the same doors. I want to know if that’s true or just resentment.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, costs matter, but if the rule makes us avoid each other, the building becomes hostile. We need a humane system.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I agree. If the spots are unfair, the morning becomes a fight. I’ll look at the physical layout and the complaints.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I hear you. But if we can’t afford the solution, it’s useless. I’ll check the ledger and the external park prices.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, the physical effort is key. If it’s too hard, it won’t last. I’ll check the supplier’s frame and the treasurer’s logs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, workload is important. But I need to know if the current allocation is actually biased. I’ll check the minutes and the sticker register.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, I’ll check the neighbouring block’s account. I want to see what happens when a charge causes people to stop showing up.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the morning departures and the rain exposure. I need to see who is getting wet and who is stuck.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the building ledger and the ward cycle park. I need the real numbers before we decide anything.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I’ll check the treasurer’s handover file and the supplier’s display frame. I need to know the hours and the physical strain.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the five years of minutes and the sticker register. I need to see if the bias is real or just talk.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
